---
module: pong
func_id: paddle-controls
---

***conformance tests***

# player-1-moves-with-w-and-s
Sending `W` to :App: moves the left :Paddle: up and sending `S` moves it down.

# player-2-moves-with-o-and-l
Sending `O` to :App: moves the right :Paddle: up and sending `L` moves it down.

# player-2-moves-with-the-arrow-keys
Sending the up arrow key to :App: moves the right :Paddle: up and sending the down arrow key moves it down.

***acceptance tests***
